ext2 mount: block=1024 inodes=128 blocks=1024
ext2 read: /hello.txt ok
ext2 write: /mutable.txt ok
ext2 resize: truncate+extend ok
ext2 bitmap: block+inode counts ok
ext2 owners: block+inode owners ok
ext2 create: create+lookup+unlink ok
ext2 symlink: /latest -> hello.txt ok
ext2 multi-block: /large.txt 3200 bytes ok
